  "title": "Metals and Miners: Policy Over Price",
  "summary": "Markets are changing and policy is becoming just as important as price in shaping the outlook for critical materials. In this edition of Metals in Motion, Sprott's Justin Tolman explains how government intervention, supply chain security and market volatility are creating new opportunities across metals and mining, while highlighting what investors should watch in the second half of 2026.",
